{{!-- Rendered only on a linked-Evade outcome card (module/chat/
      evade-link-card.mjs) when the Evade Check came back Major or Critical
      Fail (Carl RPG p.79) - a one-click convenience for the GM-facing
      "gains a Minor/Major Injury Debuff" text, never auto-applied. Click
      handler and GM/owner visibility gating are wired up client-side by the
      shared registerChatListener (module/chat/chat-listener.mjs), via this
      button's data-action and evade-link-card.mjs's evadeActionEntries. --}}
<div class="carl-evade-consequence">
  <button type="button" class="carl-add-evade-debuff" data-action="addEvadeDebuff">
    <i class="fas fa-band-aid"></i> {{debuffButtonLabel}}
  </button>
</div>
